00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:29.420
it will make me suffer one day.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:36.920
Pour ton rêve où tu vas arriver

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:36.920
For your dream that you will arrive at

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:44.360
